      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;ah-you-found-me&#34;&gt;Ah! You found me!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to meet you, I&amp;rsquo;m Wren!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m a senior Computer/Electrical Engineering student with an affinity for
side projects, ranging from woodworking to consumer electronics. I would love to
have a concise portfolio, but the documentation for many of these projects has ended
up scattered to the winds of my camera roll, local file systems, and cloud storage.
The goal is to make this site into the consolidated gallery these projects deserve.
Until then, check out the &lt;a href=&#34;https://wrental.github.io/projects&#34;&gt;projects&lt;/a&gt; page to see what I&amp;rsquo;ve been up to!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
